{"seq":2,"slug":"fee-cost-interchange-scheme-engineering","title":"费率成本工程：交换费、卡组织定价与多 PSP 成本归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-orchestration-multi-psp-routing/reconciliation-fees-observability-ops/fee-cost-interchange-scheme-engineering","wordCount":2992,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"费率成本工程-交换费-卡组织定价与多-psp-成本归因\">费率成本工程：交换费、卡组织定价与多 PSP 成本归因</h1><p>一家跨境商户接入四家 PSP 之后，最容易被忽略的事实是：<strong>收单成本不是「一个费率」，而是一条由至少五层费用叠加出来的曲线</strong>，且多数由卡组织与发卡行单方面定价、每月更新。若把 PSP 报价单上的 <code>2.9% + $0.30</code> 直接写进利润模型，实际到账往往偏差 30–80 个基点——差额来自交换费产品类别、卡组织固定费与跨区附加费。本文讨论把这五层拆开、可归因、可对账，并让路由决策以「每笔成功结算综合成本」而非「名义费率」为目标函数的工程方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-五层成本构成\">核心概念：五层成本构成</h2><p>一笔跨境卡交易的费用从发卡行一路传到商户账户，途经发卡行、卡组织、收单机构、PSP 四个主体。把它拆成可独立核算的五层，是成本工程的起点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>费用名称</th>\n<th>计价方式</th>\n<th>定价方</th>\n<th>商户能否影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>交换费 Interchange</td>\n<td>交易额百分比 + 固定费</td>\n<td>发卡行（卡组织公布建议表）</td>\n<td>类别可优化（数据字段、行业码）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>卡组织费 Scheme Fee</td>\n<td>百分比、单笔固定、月固定混合</td>\n<td>Visa / Mastercard / Amex</td>\n<td>极低，仅能靠体量谈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>收单机构加价 Acquirer Markup</td>\n<td>通常 bps + 单笔</td>\n<td>收单机构</td>\n<td>可谈判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>PSP/编排层加价 Markup</td>\n<td>bps + 单笔 + 平台费</td>\n<td>PSP / 编排服务商</td>\n<td>可谈判</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>附加成本</td>\n<td>跨币种转换、拒付、退款、降级</td>\n<td>各方</td>\n<td>部分可优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>综合一个自然月内全部交易的有效费率可写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>eff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>acq</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>psp</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>fx</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>dispute</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>refund</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>settled</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{eff}} = \\frac{IC + SF + M_{\\text{acq}} + M_{\\text{psp}} + F_{\\text{fx}} + F_{\\text{dispute}} + F_{\\text{refund}}}{V_{\\text{settled}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">eff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">acq</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">psp</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fx</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dispute</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">refund</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分母 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>settled</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{settled}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 必须用<strong>成功结算额</strong>而非发起额，这正是后文成本感知路由的目标函数所在。第 2 层还带非线性：Visa 的 Fixed Acquirer Network Fee（FANF）按月、按商户数量与受理渠道分层收取固定费，与笔数无关；Mastercard 的 Assessment Fee 则是百分比形式。两者混在一起时，单笔归因必须依赖内部摊销规则，而不能简单除以笔数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交换费的监管边界与跨区溢价\">交换费的监管边界与跨区溢价</h2><p>交换费是五层中占比最大的一层，也是唯一被多国监管直接封顶的一层。做跨境业务必须同时知道<strong>三套不同的天花板</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>欧盟</strong>：Regulation (EU) 2015/751（Interchange Fee Regulation, IFR）将 EEA 内个人卡交换费封顶为<strong>借记 0.2%、贷记 0.3%</strong>（欧洲委员会，EUR-Lex 2015/751 号条例）。英国脱欧后通过 The Payment Services Regulations 2015 保留了等值的 0.2%/0.3% 上限。</li>\n<li><strong>美国</strong>：Durbin 修正案（Dodd-Frank §1075）配合美联储 Regulation II，对资产超 100 亿美元的发行机构，借记卡交换费上限为<strong>21 美分 + 交易额的 0.05%</strong>，外加至多 1 美分的欺诈防范调整。信用卡不受此限，因此美国无卡信用卡交换费典型落在 1.5%–2.4% 区间。</li>\n<li><strong>澳大利亚</strong>：澳洲央行（RBA）对信用卡与借记卡交换费设 0.5% 的加权平均上限，并自 2021 年起推动借记卡「最低成本路由」（Least Cost Routing, LCR）要求，让商户可在本地借记网络间选择更低成本的通道——这是全球最早把路由权交回商户的监管动作之一（Reserve Bank of Australia）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>真正的成本陷阱在「跨区交换费」（interregional / cross-border interchange）。当发卡行与收单行分属不同区域时，交换费不再适用区域内的封顶值，而按卡组织公布的跨区交换费表计收，无卡跨境信用卡常见落在 <strong>1.8%–2.4%</strong>，比欧盟区内 0.3% 高出近一个数量级。这意味着<strong>同一笔 €100 的订单，若持卡人来自区域外，成本可能是区域内的七倍</strong>——路由与定价策略必须把 BIN 归属国纳入成本模型，而不是按币种或站点语言粗略判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种报价模型与可归因性\">三种报价模型与可归因性</h2><p>PSP 与收单机构的报价模型决定了成本能做多细的归因。业界通行三种：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>商户支付</th>\n<th>成本透明度</th>\n<th>归因能力</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Blended 混合费率</strong></td>\n<td>固定单一费率（如 2.9%+$0.30）</td>\n<td>低，费用被摊平</td>\n<td>仅到汇总层</td>\n<td>小体量、SKU 少的商户</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Tiered 分层费率</strong></td>\n<td>合格/中等/不合格三档费率</td>\n<td>中，但档位定义由收单方解释</td>\n<td>需反查「降级」原因</td>\n<td>传统收单合同</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>IC++ / Interchange++</strong></td>\n<td>实际交换费 + 实际卡组织费 + 固定加价</td>\n<td>高，逐笔明细</td>\n<td>可归因到卡产品级</td>\n<td>中大体量、多 PSP 编排</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>IC++ 是唯一值得作为长期依赖的模型：第 1、2 层原样透传，只对第 3 层收固定 bps + 单笔费，使商户能逐笔核对「这笔交易为什么比预期贵」。代价是<strong>降级（downgrade）风险转移给了商户</strong>：同一张 Visa 信用卡若缺少 AVS 匹配、未传 Level II/III 数据或清算批次日不符要求，就会跌入标准或非合格类别，费率跳升 30–100 个基点。因此交易请求必须携带足以「争到最优类别」的结构化字段——账单地址与邮编、商业卡与采购卡所需的 Level II/III 行项目、正确的 MCC 行业码、授权与清算金额一致——并持续维护这套字段与交换费类别的映射，它会随卡组织费率表更新而失效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多-psp-成本归因模型\">多 PSP 成本归因模型</h2><p>当同一笔订单可能由四家 PSP 中任一家承接，成本核算的第一个难题是<strong>归因维度爆炸</strong>：费用必须能按商户、PSP、支付方式、卡 BIN 国家、卡产品、渠道同时下钻，否则优化无从下手。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  TX[交易台账&lt;br/&gt;tx_id / amount / currency] --&gt; JOIN[归因联结键&lt;br/&gt;psp_ref + scheme_ref]&#10;  PSPR[PSP 逐笔费用明细&lt;br/&gt;fee_details / additionalData] --&gt; JOIN&#10;  INV[PSP 月度发票] --&gt; ALLOC[固定费摊销&lt;br/&gt;FANF / 平台费]&#10;  SCH[卡组织费率表&lt;br/&gt;Visa/MC Interchange] --&gt; MAP[类别映射&lt;br/&gt;产品+区域+渠道]&#10;  JOIN --&gt; MAP&#10;  MAP --&gt; DETAIL[逐笔成本明细&lt;br/&gt;IC + SF + markup]&#10;  ALLOC --&gt; DETAIL&#10;  DETAIL --&gt; ATTRIB[多维归因&lt;br/&gt;商户/PSP/方式/BIN国]&#10;  ATTRIB --&gt; DASH[成本仪表盘 + 异常告警]\">graph TD\n  TX[交易台账&lt;br/&gt;tx_id / amount / currency] --&gt; JOIN[归因联结键&lt;br/&gt;psp_ref + scheme_ref]\n  PSPR[PSP 逐笔费用明细&lt;br/&gt;fee_details / additionalData] --&gt; JOIN\n  INV[PSP 月度发票] --&gt; ALLOC[固定费摊销&lt;br/&gt;FANF / 平台费]\n  SCH[卡组织费率表&lt;br/&gt;Visa/MC Interchange] --&gt; MAP[类别映射&lt;br/&gt;产品+区域+渠道]\n  JOIN --&gt; MAP\n  MAP --&gt; DETAIL[逐笔成本明细&lt;br/&gt;IC + SF + markup]\n  ALLOC --&gt; DETAIL\n  DETAIL --&gt; ATTRIB[多维归因&lt;br/&gt;商户/PSP/方式/BIN国]\n  ATTRIB --&gt; DASH[成本仪表盘 + 异常告警]</pre><p>归因的联结键设计是成败关键。交易台账里的 <code>tx_id</code> 与 PSP 的 <code>psp_reference</code> 必须一一映射，而卡组织的清算参考号往往只能通过 PSP 的逐笔明细接口获得。Adyen 在 <code>/payments</code> 响应中用 <code>additionalData</code> 回传交换费与卡组织费拆分，Stripe 的 Balance Transaction 对象带 <code>fee_details</code> 数组，都是为满足 IC++ 归因设计的；若 PSP 只提供日汇总，则第 1、2 层只能靠内部费率表反推，精度会显著下降（Stripe API Reference, <code>stripe.com/docs/api/balance_transactions</code>）。</p>\n<p>固定费的摊销需要一条显式规则。FANF 一类按月的固定费，应按「商户维度 + 受理渠道」分摊，可选用交易笔数或交易额作为分摊基数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>Alloc</mtext><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mtext>fixed</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mtext> (笔数)</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mtext> (金额)</mtext><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Alloc}_m = F_{\\text{fixed}} \\times \\frac{w_m}{\\sum_{i} w_i}, \\qquad w_m \\in \\{\\,n_m \\text{ (笔数)},\\; V_m \\text{ (金额)}\\,\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Alloc</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fixed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0933em;vertical-align:-0.9857em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9857em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> (</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">笔数</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> (</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">金额</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>选择笔数还是金额作权重，会系统性改变不同 PSP 的「单位成本」排名——小额高频业务固定费占比高，用笔数分摊才真实。这一步没有唯一正确答案，但必须<strong>固定并记录</strong>，否则同一份报表在不同月份会得出矛盾结论。归因明细的落地表结构建议至少保留：<code>tx_id</code>、<code>psp</code>、<code>payment_method_type</code>、<code>card_bin_country</code>、<code>card_product</code>、<code>ic_amount</code>、<code>scheme_fee_amount</code>、<code>markup_amount</code>、<code>allocated_fixed</code>、<code>currency</code>、<code>settle_date</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本感知路由-目标函数与规模陷阱\">成本感知路由：目标函数与规模陷阱</h2><p>把上面所有层合起来，路由引擎真正要最小化的不是费率，而是<strong>每笔成功结算的综合成本</strong>。定义单次尝试的固定成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、比率成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>、授权成功率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>auth</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{auth}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">auth</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>settled</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>auth</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{settled}} = \\frac{f_0 + r \\cdot V}{P_{\\text{auth}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2074em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">auth</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子暴露了一个廉价 PSP 的陷阱：假设通道 A 费率 1.9%、授权率 86%，通道 B 费率 2.3%、授权率 96%。按名义费率 A 更便宜，但代入单位金额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V=100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.30</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1.90</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>0.86</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2.56</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_A \\approx (0.30 + 1.90)/0.86 = 2.56</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.90</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/0.86</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.56</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.30</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2.30</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>0.96</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2.71</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_B \\approx (0.30 + 2.30)/0.96 = 2.71</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.30</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/0.96</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.71</span></span></span></span></span>——此处 A 仍略优；而一旦 A 的授权率降到 82%，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2.68</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_A = 2.68</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.68</span></span></span></span></span>，B 反超。<strong>最优路由是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>settled</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C\\_{\\text{settled}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">settled</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 argmin，不是费率的 argmin</strong>，且这个 argmin 随通道的实时表现漂移。这解释了为什么费率表本身不能硬编码进路由规则，而要与授权率、拒付率的滚动统计联合求解——具体策略模型与实验方法见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../smart-routing-failover-optimization/smart-routing-tuning-experiment-ops\">智能路由调优与实验运营</a>。</p>\n<p>第二个规模化陷阱是<strong>跨币种与结算币种错配</strong>：交易币种、结算币种、商户账户币种三者不一致时，会叠加卡组织货币转换加价（Visa/Mastercard 各约 1% 量级）与收单方汇率点差，这部分不体现在任何「费率」里却直接侵蚀毛利，必须作为独立 <code>F_fx</code> 项进入模型并逐 PSP 记录结算币种与汇率来源。第三个陷阱是<strong>退款与拒付的滞后成本</strong>：退款通常保留卡组织费不退，拒付则触发固定罚金（业界典型单笔 15–50 美元，Visa 与 Mastercard 在 2025 年上调了拒付处理费）并退回交换费。把拒付率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>cb</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{cb}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cb</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与退款率作为独立乘子纳入目标函数，才能得到可比的通道排名。</p>\n<h2 id=\"费率对账与运营治理\">费率对账与运营治理</h2><p>成本工程的收尾是<strong>三方对账</strong>：内部逐笔成本明细 ↔ PSP 月度发票 ↔ 卡组织费率表。只有这三者对得齐，前面所有归因数字才可信。</p>\n<p>对账的核心动作是解释差异而非消除差异。发票金额与逐笔明细的差额通常来自三类：一是<strong>费率表更新滞后</strong>——卡组织每年大致在 4 月与 10 月两个窗口更新费率，内部映射表若未同步，就会出现系统性偏差；二是<strong>降级争议</strong>——某批交易被计为不合格类别，需回溯请求字段判断是否真的缺少必要数据，若判定为误计可向 PSP 申诉追回；三是<strong>固定费摊销口径变化</strong>，属于内部规则而非真实差异。</p>\n<p>运营治理层面还有两条合规红线。<strong>Visa Acquirer Monitoring Program（VAMP）</strong> 自 2025 年 4 月起取代 VDMP/VFMP，按收单方维度监控欺诈（TC40/TC15）与非欺诈拒付比率，阈值在千分之几量级（业界常引用的欺诈门槛约 0.5%–0.7%，超额比超 1.5 倍即触发罚金），超限收单方被收违规费并传导至商户。<strong>Mastercard Excessive Chargeback Program（ECP）</strong> 则以商户为单位按交易量分档设阈。两套计划意味着拒付率不只是成本项，而是会触发<strong>阶梯式罚金</strong>的运营指标，必须与费率对账放在同一张看板监控。</p>\n<p>工程上的落地形态是：逐笔费用明细进入数据仓库事实表，费率表与摊销规则作为缓慢变化维（SCD）保留历史版本，每月发票到达时自动跑差异检测并输出「按原因分类的差异清单」。这套管线复用故障切换与拒付观测所需的同一份事件流——异常检测与通道降级判定的数据基础是共享的，见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../smart-routing-failover-optimization/cascade-failover-retry-degradation\">级联故障切换与降级重试</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>四条可操作结论：其一，成本显式拆成五层，前三层只能优化不能谈判，后两层才是商务空间；其二，交换费的区域封顶与跨区溢价相差近一个数量级，BIN 归属国必须是一等公民字段；其三，IC++ 是唯一值得一提的报价模型，代价是降级风险自担，请求字段的校准规则要持续维护；其四，路由目标函数是每笔成功结算的综合成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>settled</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{settled}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 而非名义费率，且必须计入跨币种加价、退款与拒付罚金。做到这四点，多 PSP 架构省下的钱才是一笔能算清楚、能对账、能被审计的收益。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"费率成本工程：交换费、卡组织定价与多 PSP 成本归因","id":"费率成本工程-交换费-卡组织定价与多-psp-成本归因"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：五层成本构成","id":"核心概念-五层成本构成"},{"level":2,"text":"交换费的监管边界与跨区溢价","id":"交换费的监管边界与跨区溢价"},{"level":2,"text":"三种报价模型与可归因性","id":"三种报价模型与可归因性"},{"level":2,"text":"多 PSP 成本归因模型","id":"多-psp-成本归因模型"},{"level":2,"text":"成本感知路由：目标函数与规模陷阱","id":"成本感知路由-目标函数与规模陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"费率对账与运营治理","id":"费率对账与运营治理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多 PSP 对账与结算清算模型：结算文件、清分与内部账务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-orchestration-multi-psp-routing/reconciliation-fees-observability-ops/multi-psp-reconciliation-settlement-model"},"next":{"title":"争议拒付处理、支付可观测性与线上事故运营响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-orchestration-multi-psp-routing/reconciliation-fees-observability-ops/dispute-chargeback-observability-incident-ops"}}